                                                "sense_id": "0fbee928-c0c1-3e1c-80ee-3f7d179d178e",
                                                "text": "Printing such asinine opinions is criminal!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10389080-f78b-44ee-b222-6f23db83449c",
                                                "sense_id": "0fbee928-c0c1-3e1c-80ee-3f7d179d178e",
                                                "text": "[...] I think it represents exceptional value for money and I think it would be criminal not to go ahead and build it.\""
                                            }
